Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-iot-guard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox IoT Guard — IoT device discovery + segmentation
 Inventories IoT devices on the LAN (vendor MAC OUI, mDNS/SSDP/MQTT
 fingerprints), classifies them by type, and applies nftables
 micro-segmentation policies to keep IoT traffic isolated from
 trusted hosts.
